# Debugging Blank Screen Issue

- [/] Investigate blank screen
    - [ ] Check browser console for errors
    - [ ] Check terminal for build/runtime errors
    - [ ] Inspect `App.tsx` and `main.tsx` for mount issues
- [ ] Fix the issue
    - [ ] Resolve any rendering errors
    - [ ] Fix any CSS issues causing black screen
- [ ] Verify fix
    - [ ] Confirm app renders correctly in browser
    - [ ] Verify core functionality is still working
